Execution algorithms were extracted from Stone749990226/outdoorNav at the snapshot recorded in docs/upstream-snapshot.json. Business planning, scene assets, sensor drivers and localization implementation are not runtime dependencies of this package.
The Robonix package/lifecycle structure follows syswonder/service-navigation-rbnx. No Robonix framework source or generated bindings are vendored in the runtime source tree; those are generated against the selected SDK at build time.
Original xiangruicheng visual perception sources are retained in vendor/ with per-file source paths and SHA-256 in vendor/source_manifest.json. These include the existing RGB-D calibration checks, RTAB-Map adapter, semantic projection, and original geometric costmap helpers. Checkpoint weights are external deployment assets and are not bundled.

External segmentation adapters and their model weights retain their own licensing requirements.
